s":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m028-0019","start":19,"end":23,"surface":"平陽公主","kind":"person","person_id":"nad_18h_5jc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m028-0051","start":51,"end":55,"surface":"平陽公主","kind":"person","person_id":"nad_18h_5jc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m028-0066","start":66,"end":69,"surface":"陳皇后","kind":"person","person_id":"mj4_uma_km7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m028-0073","start":73,"end":74,"surface":"醫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、集體、制度稱號或待核短稱；不補姓名或年表。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","book_id":"b-shiji-049","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-049-waiqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:p021","text":"嬰自上初起沛，常為太僕，竟高祖崩。以太僕事孝惠。孝惠帝及高后德嬰之脫孝惠、魯元於下邑之閒也，乃賜嬰縣北第第一，曰「近我」，以尊異之。孝惠帝崩，以太僕事高后。高后崩，代王之來，嬰以太僕與東牟侯入清宮，廢少帝，以天子法駕迎代王代邸，與大臣共立為孝文皇帝，復為太僕。八歲卒，謚為文侯。子夷侯灶立，七年卒。子共侯賜立，三十一年卒。子侯頗尚平陽公主。立十九歲，元鼎二年，坐與父御婢姦罪，自殺，國除。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m021-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"li9_cmb_8ci","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m021-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m021-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"孝惠","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m021-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"孝惠帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m021-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"高后","kind":"person","person_id":"i30_mjq_6q8_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m021-0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"li9_cmb_8ci","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"i